{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233590","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233590","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1423359001:1":{"text":"All that just to teach a single topic...","source_cn":"仅仅是为了教学一个知识点，都设计得如此用心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10D756BD25E5141B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423359002:1":{"text":"No wonder the kids love learning from you, Florabelle.","source_cn":"芙拉贝尔，我大概知道你为什么会受孩子们欢迎了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF62C2A75022C036","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423359003:1":{"text":"It's true that constant learning and improving your teaching skills matters, but that's not what makes the biggest difference.","source_cn":"其实，持续不断的学习和磨炼教学技巧固然重要，但都不是决...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D14B6F501C99ED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423359004:1":{"text":"The most important thing is caring. Really caring about the kids, seeing the world through their eyes, and becoming someone they trust...","source_cn":"最重要的是要发自内心地去关爱孩子，理解孩子，直至走进孩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3342CFD03E8EDC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423359005:1":{"text":"Orlana, I think you know how to do that too.","source_cn":"欧罗娜，我觉得你也有这样的一颗心呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEF3F57474296CEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1423359005":{"text":"Orlana, I think you know how to do that too.","source_cn":"欧罗娜，我觉得你也有这样的一颗心呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEF3F57474296CEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423359006:1":{"text":"I...","source_cn":"……我……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5AFD4F213B31EFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423359007:1":{"text":"Miss Florabelle, we finished observing the plants! I counted five stamens on the etching iris!","source_cn":"芙拉贝尔老师，我们观察完啦，我发现蚀芯花有五根花蕊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x518A4F7425B97E15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423359008:1":{"text":"And I saw rings on the fuzzy mushroom's cap, like little ripples!","source_cn":"我发现茸茸伞菇的伞面上有一圈一圈的花纹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCEA5E27C8FB6E1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423359009:1":{"text":"You both made great discoveries! We've alr